<title>POLAND: LDA OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 45.000.</title>
<headline>LDA OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 45.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   0.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.09 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.08 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Sales		    2.62 vs   2.29</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.78 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.38 vs   0.80</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.31 vs   1.20</p>
<p> Sales		   25.51 vs  22.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish printer house is Lodzka</p>
<p>Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
